## Type additions
# Note: gradle, tf, java, kotlin, yaml are already built-in ripgrep types
# (the built-ins are broader), so no --type-add is needed for them.

# ignore case
--smart-case

# Markdown (and MDX)
--type-add
md:*.{md,mdx}

# follow symlinks
--follow

# include hidden files
--hidden

# Don't go into the .git/ directory
--glob=!.git/*
